  "guide": {
    "intro": [
      "Sufism is the mystical dimension of Islam, a path of love, remembrance and inner purification. It has produced some of the world’s most beloved poetry.",
      "Orders such as the Mevlevi, Qadiri and Naqshbandi each keep their own practices of dhikr, music, poetry and service."
    ],
